  website={https://yingjiahao14.github.io/BTE-web/},
  abstract={Belief-Trajectory Energy (BTE) measures how a language model revises its predictions across layers. It turns these revisions into a scalar score or a depth profile, providing signals for reasoning difficulty, human-versus-LLM review detection, and generator attribution. Analyses across pretraining and targeted training show how these signals depend on what the scoring model has learned.},
